## Non-Negotiable Calculation Rules

Violating any of these creates silent data errors. Do not deviate without an explicit decision logged in the spec.

### Revenue column
```
✅ gross_revenue
❌ net_owner_revenue — this column no longer exists (renamed Sprint 11)
```
Net owner revenue is computed at query time only when pm_fee_pct is known:
`gross_revenue * (1 - pm_fee_pct)` — never stored, never used as a base metric.

### Nights column
```
✅ (check_out::date - check_in::date)  — computed inline every time
❌ nights  — this column does not exist in the bookings table
```

### Cross-month booking proration — REQUIRED on every revenue/nights query
Every query summing revenue or counting nights must use the overlap formula.
Never attribute full booking values to a single period when a booking crosses a month boundary.

```sql
-- Overlap days
overlap_days = LEAST(check_out::date, period_end::date)
             - GREATEST(check_in::date, period_start::date)

-- Prorated revenue
prorated_revenue = gross_revenue
  * (LEAST(check_out::date, period_end::date)
     - GREATEST(check_in::date, period_start::date))::numeric
  / (check_out::date - check_in::date)::numeric

-- Booking inclusion filter (always include all three conditions)
check_in < period_end
AND check_out > period_start
AND check_in < CURRENT_DATE   -- excludes future bookings
```

### Future bookings
```
✅ Stored in bookings table as-is
✅ Excluded from all analytics via: check_in < CURRENT_DATE
❌ Never appear in any closed-period revenue, occupancy, ADR, or RevPAR calculation
```

### Available nights denominator
```
available_nights = calendar_nights
                 − planned_owner_stay_nights    (is_planned_owner_stay = true, booked ≥14 days prior)
                 − owner_guest_nights           (block_type = 'owner_guest')
                 − maintenance_nights           (block_type = 'maintenance')
```
Last-minute owner stays (booked <14 days prior) are NOT subtracted — they reduce revenue but not the denominator.

### Portfolio RevPAR
```
✅ SUM(revenue) / SUM(available_nights)  — available-nights-weighted
❌ AVG(property_revpar)                  — never average the averages
```

### Benchmark metrics
```
benchmark_occ    — stored as 0–100 percentage scale. Use as-is. DO NOT divide by 100.
benchmark_adr    — stored as day-weighted rate. Use as-is.
benchmark_revpar — stored as day-weighted rate. Use as-is.
```
All three are day-weighted rates, not daily fractions. Aggregation uses day-weighted average:
```sql
SUM(benchmark_revpar * days_in_period) / SUM(days_in_period)
```

### Benchmark chart guard — applies to BOTH analytics page and dashboard
Only plot benchmark weeks where the ISO week start date falls within a month
that has `data_complete = true` in `property_coverage_months`.

```sql
JOIN property_coverage_months pcm
  ON pcm.property_id   = :property_id
  AND pcm.coverage_year  = EXTRACT(year  FROM mb.week_start_date)::int
  AND pcm.coverage_month = EXTRACT(month FROM mb.week_start_date)::int
  AND pcm.data_complete  = true
```

